of various shapes.  A "key" might ID as an "uncursed square key" and
so in.  Once you identified a skeleton key (either by scroll or by
using
it in mor ethan one lock with a known shape) it was time to ignore all
further unknown key types.  Eventually only the skeleton key was
retained in the game.

So there's precedent for doing it as described.  But once you have one
"blessed greased fireproof +5 yellow hawaiian shirt" you're set and
you
no longer care that other colors are available.  Just like the ancient
key
code there's also precedent that it's not worth retaining the code
even
if it already exists in the game.

